for(const id of ['ganttStatus','ganttSpan','ganttMonth','ganttDate'])$(id).onchange=render;$('ganttToday').onclick=()=>{$('ganttMonth').value=today().slice(0,7);$('ganttDate').value=today();render()};$('ganttReload').onclick=load;
$('ganttOwner').onchange=()=>{selectedMembers.clear();render()};
root.addEventListener('click',e=>{const member=e.target.closest('[data-gantt-member]'),self=e.target.closest('[data-gantt-self]'),all=e.target.closest('[data-gantt-all]'),group=e.target.closest('[data-gantt-group]');if(member){const n=member.dataset.ganttMember;selectedMembers.has(n)?selectedMembers.delete(n):selectedMembers.add(n);}if(self){selectedMembers=new Set([currentMember]);$('ganttScale').value='week';scale();}if(all){selectedMembers.clear();$('ganttOwner').value='';}if(group){groupMode=group.dataset.ganttGroup;root.querySelectorAll('[data-gantt-group]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b===group)));}if(member||self||all||group)render();});document.addEventListener('studio-kpt-saved',()=>{if(loaded)load();});
